    "notes": "Inspected all 12 views plus a full-size right orbit to check the drawer pulls. Twin pedestal carcass with six drawers, each with a separately modelled metal pull, and a closed modesty panel confirmed in the back view. The 4 is for materials: the grey steel is quite flat and uniform with little edge wear, so it reads cleaner than a used desk should.",
